      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that this behavior is different than Dawn atm when passing `descriptor \u003d nullptr` as default. I think that we should either make the default callback mode for device lost `AllowSpontaneous` so that it\u0027s set in `WGPU_DEVICE_DESCRIPTOR_INIT`, or we should override it here. It feels silly to allow users to default `nullptr` but that will cause a validation error.\n\nAlso, I caught this issue last because I built and ran the WASM tests. I think this change will break it again. Can you run it to make sure it\u0027s passing?",
